    "name": "After Lights Out",
    "steam_appid": 3611700,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611700/extras/7db5c3c5a2017c7940c3b4409a8f0791.poster.avif?t=1747761600\" width=616 height=265 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611700/extras/7db5c3c5a2017c7940c3b4409a8f0791.webm?t=1747761600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>If you ever felt a chill down your spine at the moment the lights went out in your childhood, in After Lights Out, you will experience that mix of fun and horror once again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After Lights Out is a first person psychological horror game where light takes on an extraordinary significance. Players must overcome their inner fears and bravely step into the darkness, while skillfully using lights to solve a series of intricate puzzles. As you investigate every horror and mystery that takes place in this house, you gradually uncover the rules and truth behind the story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Storyline</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in an unfamiliar room with fragmented memories, even forgetting your own identity. You seem to be a journalist investigating a missing persons case. A throbbing headache weighs on you. Everything in the room feels both alien and eerily familiar\u2014marked doors, flickering lights, even a corpse lying on the floor...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...Daughters? Yes, I'm investigating the disappearance of the twin daughters in this house!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611700/extras/29bec06a547a34134f465b5953f11144.avif?t=1747761600\" data-has-big width=800 height=344 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment shifts dynamically with changes in lighting. Use light strategically to reveal hidden secrets, but beware\u2014danger may lurk the moment the lights go out...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611700/extras/a18f082f060504198c811d48aac79414.poster.avif?t=1747761600\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611700/extras/a18f082f060504198c811d48aac79414.webm?t=1747761600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611700/extras/a18f082f060504198c811d48aac79414.mp4?t=1747761600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect clues in-game using a camera, uncovering stories behind each room and character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611700/extras/2aac643f848eff876d0450de5ba1a361.poster.avif?t=1747761600\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611700/extras/2aac643f848eff876d0450de5ba1a361.webm?t=1747761600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611700/extras/2aac643f848eff876d0450de5ba1a361.mp4?t=1747761600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect clues on an evidence board to piece together the full narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611700/extras/570c93897817bd5e1043a93a84d9af4e.poster.avif?t=1747761600\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611700/extras/570c93897817bd5e1043a93a84d9af4e.webm?t=1747761600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611700/extras/570c93897817bd5e1043a93a84d9af4e.mp4?t=1747761600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611700/extras/7db5c3c5a2017c7940c3b4409a8f0791.poster.avif?t=1747761600\" width=616 height=265 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611700/extras/7db5c3c5a2017c7940c3b4409a8f0791.webm?t=1747761600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>If you ever felt a chill down your spine at the moment the lights went out in your childhood, in After Lights Out, you will experience that mix of fun and horror once again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After Lights Out is a first person psychological horror game where light takes on an extraordinary significance. Players must overcome their inner fears and bravely step into the darkness, while skillfully using lights to solve a series of intricate puzzles. As you investigate every horror and mystery that takes place in this house, you gradually uncover the rules and truth behind the story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Storyline</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in an unfamiliar room with fragmented memories, even forgetting your own identity. You seem to be a journalist investigating a missing persons case. A throbbing headache weighs on you. Everything in the room feels both alien and eerily familiar\u2014marked doors, flickering lights, even a corpse lying on the floor...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...Daughters? Yes, I'm investigating the disappearance of the twin daughters in this house!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611700/extras/29bec06a547a34134f465b5953f11144.avif?t=1747761600\" data-has-big width=800 height=344 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment shifts dynamically with changes in lighting. Use light strategically to reveal hidden secrets, but beware\u2014danger may lurk the moment the lights go out...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611700/extras/a18f082f060504198c811d48aac79414.poster.avif?t=1747761600\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611700/extras/a18f082f060504198c811d48aac79414.webm?t=1747761600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611700/extras/a18f082f060504198c811d48aac79414.mp4?t=1747761600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect clues in-game using a camera, uncovering stories behind each room and character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611700/extras/2aac643f848eff876d0450de5ba1a361.poster.avif?t=1747761600\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611700/extras/2aac643f848eff876d0450de5ba1a361.webm?t=1747761600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611700/extras/2aac643f848eff876d0450de5ba1a361.mp4?t=1747761600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect clues on an evidence board to piece together the full narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611700/extras/570c93897817bd5e1043a93a84d9af4e.poster.avif?t=1747761600\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611700/extras/570c93897817bd5e1043a93a84d9af4e.webm?t=1747761600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611700/extras/570c93897817bd5e1043a93a84d9af4e.mp4?t=1747761600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
